+Pause invalidates helper epochs. Restore discards queued touch motion, emits lifts from the last delivered state, and detaches until a fresh helper maps the current display. The changed xHCI state size changes the native snapshot fingerprint; older incompatible saves are rejected and retained for recovery rather than silently loaded.
